OL,3,GNEWSAMurder inquiry as 'loving' man
OL,4,Adies after assault
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe family of a man who died following
OL,7,Fa reported assault in Leicester have
OL,8,Fdescribed him as a "loving and loyal"
OL,9,Fbrother and son.
OL,11,FTwo people have been arrested as part
OL,12,Fof a murder inquiry into the death of
OL,13,F27-year-old George Glover in hospital
OL,14,Fon Thursday.
OL,16,FPolice said they were contacted on
OL,17,FWednesday by the family of a man who
OL,18,Fwas being treated for life-threatening
OL,19,Finjuries at the Queen's Medical Centre
OL,20,Fin Nottingham after he was found on
OL,21,FNarborough Road at about 06:30 BST on
OL,22,FMonday.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
